"use strict";
module.exports = /*#__PURE__*/JSON.parse('{"version":"1.0.0","lastUpdated":"2026-04-03","sections":[{"id":"intro","title":"Welcome to JPE Studio","content":"JPE stands for **Just Plain English** – a simple, readable syntax for creating The Sims 4 mods without complex XML or programming knowledge. Instead of fighting with tags, you write sentences that describe what your mod does.","items":[{"id":"why-jpe","title":"Why use JPE?","content":"JPE is designed to be **Human-Readable**, **Beginner-Friendly**, and **Industrial-Scale Ready**. It minimizes errors by using a clear, hierarchical structure (indentation) and plain English keywords."},{"id":"getting-started","title":"Your First Mod","content":"Create a `.jpe` file and define an interaction. For example:\\n\\n```jpe\\nMy First Interaction\\n  description: \\"Hello World\\"\\n  tests:\\n    - actor is adult\\n```\\nBuild it (Ctrl+B) and JPE Studio handles the rest.","playground":"My First Interaction\\n  description: \\"Hello World\\"\\n  tests:\\n    - actor is adult"}]},{"id":"syntax","title":"JPE Syntax Basics","content":"The foundation of JPE is **Indentation**. Like the game itself, JPE has a clear hierarchy.","items":[{"id":"indentation","title":"Indentation (2 Spaces)","content":"Hierarchy is shown by indenting exactly **2 spaces**. Parent properties contain children.\\n\\n```jpe\\nParent\\n  Child Property: Value\\n  Nested Group:\\n    Grandchild: Value\\n```"},{"id":"data-types","title":"Data Types","content":"- **Strings**: `\\"Like this\\"` (use quotes for spaces)\\n- **Numbers**: `100` or `0.75`\\n- **Lists**: Use `-` for multiple items (e.g., tests or effects)."}]},{"id":"core-concepts","title":"Core Concepts","content":"Mods are built from four primary blocks: Interactions, Buffs, Traits, and Tests.","items":[{"id":"interactions","title":"Interactions (Actions)","content":"Interactions are what Sims *do*. They have descriptions, types, and conditions.\\n\\n```jpe\\nGreet Sim\\n  type: social\\n  duration: 10\\n```","playground":"Greet Sim\\n  type: social\\n  duration: 10\\n  tests:\\n    - actor is happy"},{"id":"buffs","title":"Buffs (Moodlets)","content":"Temporary emotional effects. They have intensity and duration.\\n\\n```jpe\\nFeeling Fine\\n  mood_type: positive\\n  intensity: 2\\n  duration: 240\\n```"},{"id":"tests","title":"Tests (Conditions)","content":"Tests determine if an action can happen. Examples: `actor is adult`, `actor has cooking skill >= 5`."}]},{"id":"pro-utilities","title":"Industrial Pro Utilities","content":"For professional modders managing massive libraries, JPE Studio includes high-fidelity binary tools.","items":[{"id":"stream-writer","title":"Industrial Stream Writer","content":"When updating massive mods (>1GB), JPE Studio uses a sequential binary stream writer. This ensures **zero memory crashes** by reconstructing files chunk-by-chunk instead of loading the whole file into RAM.","context":"utilities/update"},{"id":"collision-hashing","title":"Size-Collision Optimization","content":"The Mods Cleanup utility is optimized for industrial speed. It only hashes files if they share the exact same byte-size, reducing disk IO by **90%** on standard mod folders.","context":"utilities/cleanup"},{"id":"manifest-patching","title":"One-Click Manifest Update","content":"You can patch mod version numbers and metadata directly in the binary without needing the original source XML or re-exporting from external tools.","context":"utilities/manifest"}]},{"id":"advanced","title":"Advanced Techniques","content":"Mastering complex mod logic and conditional chains.","items":[{"id":"conditional-nesting","title":"Advanced Conditional Nesting","content":"You can nest tests to create complex logic trees. A Sims 4 interaction can require multiple age, skill, and mood conditions simultaneously.\\n\\n```jpe\\nMaster Chef Kiss\\n  tests:\\n    - actor cooking skill >= 10\\n    - actor is inspired\\n    - target is food lover\\n```","playground":"Master Chef Kiss\\n  tests:\\n    - actor cooking skill >= 10\\n    - actor is inspired\\n    - target is food lover"}]}]}');

